{"suttaId":"tha-ap211","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7562,7574],"vripara":"40"},"segments":{"tha-ap211:0.3":"Ādhāradāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap211:1.1":"“Ādhārakaṃ mayā dinnaṃ, sikhino lokabandhuno;","tha-ap211:1.3":"Dhāremi pathaviṃ sabbaṃ, kevalaṃ vasudhaṃ imaṃ.","tha-ap211:2.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā;","tha-ap211:2.3":"Dhāremi antimaṃ dehaṃ, sammāsambuddhasāsane.","tha-ap211:3.1":"“Sattavīse ito kappe, ahesuṃ caturo janā;","tha-ap211:3.3":"Samantavaraṇā nāma, cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap211:4.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap211:5.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ādhāradāyako [pariyādāniyo (ka.)] thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap211:6.1":"Ādhāradāyakattherassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
